BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DAY INTO NIGHT: Patrick Mason
DTSTART:20260822T160000
DTEND:20260822T160000
UID:14bb69597f6c9c4b03cab55d53c8a1ad@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:On August 22\, Warehouse 131 transforms into a two room\, all 
 day experience\, closing out summer with a party that starts in the sun an
 d pushes deep into the night. From 4pm to 4am\, expect daytime house\, out
 door energy\, and a full shift into warehouse techno as the night takes ov
 er. Inside\, Patrick Mason headlines the indoor techno stage\, brought to 
 you by TAKEOVER 6IX. Known for commanding dancefloors from Berghain to Tom
 orrowland\, Patrick brings his signature blend of techno\, house\, and ful
 l body performance\, blurring the line between DJ and performer and turnin
 g every moment into something physical and unpredictable. Alongside Patric
 k\, Toronto collective TAKEOVER 6IX curates the indoor stage with a distin
 ct energy rooted in the local underground. Expect a harder\, deeper sound\
 , late night pressure\, and a room built for full release. Two rooms. Two 
 energies. One day into night experience. ‍
LOCATION:131 McCormack\, 131 McCormack Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/day-into-night-patrick-mason
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
