  TO STAY UP TO DATE! This is FREE to attend but if you RSVP you get entere
 d into a draw to get $25 to spend at the market! Name will be drawn the ni
 ght before the event. One entry per person. The entrance\, washroom and sp
 ace are wheelchair accessible. MOBILITY DEVICE ACCESSIBILITY : IMPORTANT A
