UID:42d8d141b5bc6dc9527c704a1fc0f5ef@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:SHANGO W/ EDDIE LOGIX (DETROIT)\, KIKI LEFREAK\, BLKVIRGO &amp
 \; SAKIKO NAGAI 2 Floors of fun DJs up and downstairs! Featuring Eddie Log
 ix who is a Detroit-based DJ\, producer and audio engineer with hands in m
 any projects\, who has been quietly at the heart of the Detroit undergroun
 d for decades. His first solo dance vinyl EP release ‘Placebo Palace’ 
 on Rocksteady Disco sold out immediately in early 2020\; his 2023 follow-u
 p release ‘Flight Risk’ took off just as quickly. Out now is the ‘Ed
 its from Detroit Vol. 5’ split with Peter Croce on Rocksteady Disco and 
 ‘1000 dollars’ collaborative album with Airjob on J94 Records. He rece
 ntly played the Pyramid Stage at the international Movement Festival B2B w
 ith Rocksteady Disco label head Peter Croce. With stylings ranging from Ho
 use and Disco to Balearic\, Ambient and Hip Hop\, Eddie holds various loca
 l residencies in Detroit\, and travels frequently to play in other cities 
 like Chicago\, New York\, Seattle and Toronto. Shango is Toronto’s favou
 rite underground party for the freaks\, geeks\, queers\, dancers and heads
 ! . Supported by Shango’s founder Kiki LeFreak and BLKVIRGO. Plus a bonu
 s special vinyl only 4 hour set in the jama by Sakiko NAGAI. Thank you eve
 ryone for your continued support and your help in creating a safe and lovi
 ng space for us to be free in! SHANGO is a safe space. PLUR in full effect
  Peace Love Unity and Respect. NO judgement\, homophobia\, racism\, sexual
  harassment or unwanted touching 10pm to LATE 1.4 hertz &amp\; the jama 96
 1 College st ‍
LOCATION:1point4hertz\, 961 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/shango-with-eddie-logix-detroit-kiki-lefre
