  to extend your Fan Expo weekend? Looking to surround yourself with joy an
 d nostalgia? It’s a ATLA TRIVIA NIGHT with DRAG! Featuring The Virgo Que
 en and Kurt C*mstain *** TICKETS INCLUDE ONE FREE DRINK! *** BRING A TEAM 
 or COME ALONE or in pairs and be matched up with friendly strangers on tea
 ms. 8pm - Doors 8:30pm - Drag! 8:45pm - First Round of Trivia! 9:15pm - Br
 eak! 9:30pm - More Drag! 9:50pm - Second Round of Trivia! 10:30pm - End TR
 IVIA - How it works You can either sign up as a TEAM or as SOLO. A TEAM is
  a table of up to 6 people. SOLOs will be put into teams of 4-6 with peopl
 e they don’t know. It’s a great way to make friends! (note: if like 2 
 or 3 people want to play together but also want to meet new people\, sign 
 up as SOLOs and we will keep you together and add new people to your mix) 
 For the trivia\, the questions will be like: 80% from the ATLA orignal ani
 mated series 20% from Korra DRAG - How it works It&#x27\;s the winner of C
 anada&#x27\;s Drag Race: The Virgo Queen And your water bending will drip 
 after seeing: Kurt C*mstain Bring your 5s and 10s to tip your drag artists
  and show them some love. TICKETS! Tickets are $16 per person and YOU GET 
 A FREE DRINK WITH YOUR TICKET! (alcoholic or sober). DRINKS AND FOOD We wi
 ll be serving alcohol and sober drinks at this event. We will also have pa
 ckage snacks (chips\, cookies\, etc) for you to munch on. You can bring in
  any food you want\, but not other drinks. And as a bonus: Everyone gets o
 ne free drink with your ticket purchase! ‍
