SUMMARY:TOTE BAG PAINTING WORKSHOP
DTSTART:20260831T190000
DTEND:20260831T190000
UID:0a8e0ac1156e244e6d0d4a1cd33987bd@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join local queer artist Emmy Tran at Come As You Are for a mon
 thly guided painting workshop! Each month features a different theme Learn
  about basic colour theory and painting techniques All supplies are provid
 ed (tote bag\, acrylic paint\, brushes\, palette) Express your creativity 
 and play within a safe community space Take home your own tote bag! Theme:
  Pride\, fruits\, positive vibes\, florals\, colourful palettes About Emmy
  Tran Emmy Tran (She/They) is a self-taught visual artist based in Toronto
 . Her art is a response to her lived experiences\, centering community\, c
 ollective liberation\, and her queer identity. She specializes in acrylic 
 paint. Her signature style explores bold intense splashes of everyday feel
 ings and sociopolitical issues using vibrant colours and text commentary. 
 About Come As You Are Founded in 1997 as a worker-cooperative\, we’re fu
 ndamentally anti-capitalist in our approach to sex toy retail\, and we tak
 e an activist stance in our approach to sexual health\, education\, and pl
 easure. ‍
LOCATION:Come as You Are\, 464 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tote-bag-painting-workshop
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
