BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:&quot\;How Queer Are You?&quot\; Presented by Mimi Osa
DTSTART:20260909T190000
DTEND:20260909T190000
UID:8e18b453ad5bde6db4621e5b495b3a79@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Mimi Osa tries to determine the exact qualities that make some
 one queer &quot\;enough&quot\;...through the power of comedy! It&#x27\;s &
 quot\;How Queer Are You?&quot\; 2: Electric Boogaloo! She&#x27\;s doing it
  again baby! Kingston drag legend and Toronto &quot\;nobody&quot\; Mimi Os
 a is back for another round of her absolutely hilarious comedy and drag ev
 ent where she aims to find out just how queer these five new performers re
 ally are. Through tried and tested methods that don&#x27\;t involve physic
 al touch for once\, Mimi will quantify and validate the identity of each g
 uest performer once they&#x27\;ve had a chance to take the stage to really
  show off why they have those several impassioned instagram followers. Wha
 t makes her the arbiter of what&#x27\;s hip with the alphabet mafia? Who k
 nows! But she needs to use her Gender Studies degree somehow! Expect humor
 ous lipsyncing\, brief moments of tender human interaction\, and a whole l
 ot of laughs. September 9th at Hail Mary on College Street! Mimi Osa has b
 een performing in drag for over a decade\, and was instrumental in buildin
 g a now thriving and diverse drag community in Kingston\, Ontario where sh
 e produced a monthly one-woman show titled Off the Record. Since moving to
  Toronto\, her proudest achievement was this year&#x27\;s private Pride mo
 nth video performance to Brave by Sara Bareilles meant for a group of seve
 n gay teen orphans\, which turned out to be a total scam. It&#x27\;s the t
 hought that counts. Allysin Chaynes is not new to the Toronto drag scene b
 ut will be tackling the world of comedy next\, performing a standup set ou
 t of drag. In drag\, you can often find her at the Bovine Sex Club on Wedn
 esday nights for Pussy Whipped Wednesdays. Cameron Crookston is a Toronto 
 based comedian and professional homosexual. When he&#x27\;s not on stage h
 e&#x27\;s trying to come up with a better second line in his bio. Carly Ra
 e Stepson might be new to Toronto&#x27\;s drag scene but she has already b
 ecome a celebrated regular at Anthony Oliveira&#x27\;s Dumpster Raccoon at
  the Revue Cinema performing drag tributes to everything from Barbarella t
 o those two weird scenes in the 90s Captain America movie where he steals 
 a car. She was also a featured performer at the 2025 WTFestival&#x27\;s Im
 possible Cabaret. Gomorrah is a drag entity new to the Toronto scene\, but
  has been working as a performer in New York City. They&#x27\;ve been a fr
 equent co-host of the show La Boix in the hottest queer cesspit known to t
 hing(s) - Brooklyn! Sandy Joint is your regularly scheduled Saturday morni
 ng cartoons! With an affinity for The Muppets and creating spaces for sobe
 r people to have fun too\, he&#x27\;s recently been exploring the craft of
  puppet making! Doors open at 7pm\, Show starts at 8pm. *If you&#x27\;re a
  queer identified comic or performer of any kind and would like to see you
 rself represented on a future lineup\, send Mimi a DM on Instagram: @mimio
 saqueen. She&#x27\;s always looking for fresh talent to exploit! ‍
LOCATION:Hail Mary\, 582 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/how-queer-are-you-presented-by-mimi-osa-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
