DTSTART:20260919T190000
DTEND:20260919T190000
UID:10310577c8f2194b1b103d1d32d816b7@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Queer Nerds Unite! Prepare yourself for trouble (and make it d
 ouble) We&#x27\;re bringing you THE Pokémon themed Drag Show of the year!
  &quot\;Hello there! Welcome to the world of POKÉMON! This world is inhab
 ited by creatures called POKÉMON! For some people\, POKÉMON are pets. Ot
 hers use them for fights. Myself...I study POKÉMON as a profession. First
 \, what is your name?&quot\; Johto You Better Don’t is a nerdy Pokémon-
 themed cabaret show\, brought to you by the unstable fusion of both Seyonc
 é Knows and Molly Kewl! Think memes\, themes\, and big dreams! Prepare to
  have your childhood ruined! Poké-ing fun and paying homage to your favou
 rite moments from the video/card games\, shows\, and movies. We&#x27\;ve c
 aught some of the best Poké-performers in town\, maxed them out on rare c
 andies\, and\, and now we&#x27\;re ready to take on the Elite Four! Welcom
 e our perfected team consisting of: 🔴Our Uber Ace in your hole: Yovksa!
  ⚪Shaking things up with Milkshook! 🔴We&#x27\;re never gonna run out 
